# .agraph layout

When writing or editing a `.agraph` graph, place nodes in a logical chain from left to right following execution and data flow.

- Each next step sits to the right of the step it follows.
- Data that feeds a step sits beside that step, not on top of it.
- Do not stack nodes on the same coordinates.
- Keep enough space between nodes that wires read as a sequence.
